\n\nLet's calculate the distances for each point:\n\n1. For \\(\\left(-3 + 2\\sqrt{9 + \\sqrt{41}}, 10 + \\sqrt{41}\\right)\\):\n\\[\nd_1 = \\sqrt{\\left(-3 + 2\\sqrt{9 + \\sqrt{41}} + 3\\right)^2 + \\left(10 + \\sqrt{41} - 2\\right)^2} = \\sqrt{\\left(2\\sqrt{9 + \\sqrt{41}}\\right)^2 + \\left(8 + \\sqrt{41}\\right)^2}\n\\]\n\\[\nd_1 = \\sqrt{4(9 + \\sqrt{41}) + (64 + 16\\sqrt{41} + 41)} = \\sqrt{36 + 4\\sqrt{41} + 105 + 16\\sqrt{41}} = \\sqrt{141 + 20\\sqrt{41}}\n\\]\n\n2. For \\(\\left(-3 - 2\\sqrt{9 + \\sqrt{41}}, 10 + \\sqrt{41}\\right)\\):\n\\[\nd_2 = \\sqrt{\\left(-3 - 2\\sqrt{9 + \\sqrt{41}} + 3\\right)^2 + \\left(10 + \\sqrt{41} - 2\\right)^2} = \\sqrt{\\left(-2\\sqrt{9 + \\sqrt{41}}\\right)^2 + \\left(8 + \\sqrt{41}\\right)^2}\n\\]\n\\[\nd_2 = \\sqrt{4(9 + \\sqrt{41}) + (64 + 16\\sqrt{41} + 41)} = \\sqrt{36 + 4\\sqrt{41} + 105 + 16\\sqrt{41}} = \\sqrt{141 + 20\\sqrt{41}}\n\\]\n\n3. For \\(\\left(-3 + 2\\sqrt{9 - \\sqrt{41}}, 10 - \\sqrt{41}\\right)\\):\n\\[\nd_3 = \\sqrt{\\left(-3 + 2\\sqrt{9 - \\sqrt{41}} + 3\\right)^2 + \\left(10 - \\sqrt{41} - 2\\right)^2} = \\sqrt{\\left(2\\sqrt{9 - \\sqrt{41}}\\right)^2 + \\left(8 - \\sqrt{41}\\right)^2}\n\\]\n\\[\nd_3 = \\sqrt{4(9 - \\sqrt{41}) + (64 - 16\\sqrt{41} + 41)} = \\sqrt{36 - 4\\sqrt{41} + 105 - 16\\sqrt{41}} = \\sqrt{141 - 20\\sqrt{41}}\n\\]\n\n4. For \\(\\left(-3 - 2\\sqrt{9 - \\sqrt{41}}, 10 - \\sqrt{41}\\right)\\):\n\\[\nd_4 = \\sqrt{\\left(-3 - 2\\sqrt{9 - \\sqrt{41}} + 3\\right)^2 + \\left(10 - \\sqrt{41} - 2\\right)^2} = \\sqrt{\\left(-2\\sqrt{9 - \\sqrt{41}}\\right)^2 + \\left(8 - \\sqrt{41}\\right)^2}\n\\]\n\\[\nd_4 = \\sqrt{4(9 - \\sqrt{41}) + (64 - 16\\sqrt{41} + 41)} = \\sqrt{36 - 4\\sqrt{41} + 105 - 16\\sqrt{41}} = \\sqrt{141 - 20\\sqrt{41}}\n\\]\n\nThe sum of the distances is:\n\\[\nd_1 + d_2 + d_3 + d_4 = \\sqrt{141 + 20\\sqrt{41}} + \\sqrt{141 + 20\\sqrt{41}} + \\sqrt{141 - 20\\sqrt{41}} + \\sqrt{141 - 20\\sqrt{41}} = 2\\sqrt{141 + 20\\sqrt{41}} + 2\\sqrt{141 - 20\\sqrt{41}}\n\\]\n\nLet's ca