ges of Navin, Luka, and Ian into a common currency, such as US dollars. We will then calculate their daily earnings in US dollars and compare them.\n\n1. Convert Navin's hourly wage to US dollars.\n2. Convert Luka's hourly wage to US dollars.\n3. Convert Ian's hourly wage to US dollars.\n4. Calculate the daily earnings for each person.\n5. Compare the daily earnings to determine who earns the most.\n\nLet's start by performing these calculations step-by-step using Python.\n```python\n# Given data\nnavin_hourly_wage_mr = 160  # rupees per hour\nluka_hourly_wage_kuna = 25  # kuna per hour\nian_hourly_wage_pula = 34  # pula per hour\n\n# Conversion rates\nusd_per_mr = 1 / 32.35  # dollars per rupee\nusd_per_kuna = 1 / 5.18  # dollars per kuna\nusd_per_pula = 1 / 6.95  # dollars per pula\n\n# Convert hourly wages to US dollars\nnavin_hourly_wage_usd = navin_hourly_wage_mr * usd_per_mr\nluka_hourly_wage_usd = luka_hourly_wage_kuna * usd_per_kuna\nian_hourly_wage_usd = ian_hourly_wage_pula * usd_per_pula\n\n# Calculate daily earnings (8 hours per day)\nnavin_daily_earnings_usd = navin_hourly_wage_usd * 8\nluka_daily_earnings_usd = luka_hourly_wage_usd * 8\nian_daily_earnings_usd = ian_hourly_wage_usd * 8\n\n# Print the daily earnings in US dollars\nprint((navin_daily_earnings_usd, luka_daily_earnings_usd, ian_daily_earnings_usd))\n```\n```output\n(39.56043956043956, 38.46153846153846, 39.42028985507246)\n```\nThe daily earnings in US dollars are as follows:\n- Navin: \\$39.56\n- Luka: \\$38.46\n- Ian: \\$39.42\n\nAfter comparing the daily earnings, we can see that Navin earns the most after working an eight-hour day.\n\nSo the answer is \\(\\boxed{\\text{Navin}}\\).", 'To determine who earns the most after an eight-hour workday, we need to convert the hourly wages of Navin, Luka, and Ian into US dollars and then calculate their daily earnings. Here are the steps:\n\n1. Convert Navin\'s hourly wage from rupees to US dollars.\n2. Convert Luka\'s hourly wage from kuna to US 